        "content_type": "section_title",
        "action": "preserve",
        "modern_text": "○曲尺之長",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book005-b000059-p000-a87b6d5432",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "一白二黑三碧四綠五黃六白七赤八白九紫一○論曲尺根由",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book005-b000060-p000-700bcfc05d",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "曲尺者有十寸，一寸乃十分。凡遇起造經營、開門高低長短度量，皆在此上，須當湊對魯般尺八寸吉凶相度，則吉多凶少為佳。匠者但用倣此，大吉也。《曹班經》卷之十四。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book005-b000061-p000-bb286ebd9a",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "section_title",
        "action": "preserve",
        "modern_text": "○惟起造何首合自吉星",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book005-b000062-p000-4cc5f5ec0e",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "《魯般經營》凡人造宅門，門一須用準與不準，及起造室院條緝車箭，須用準合陰陽，然後使尺寸量慶，用合財吉星及三白星方為吉。其白外但則九紫為小吉。人要合魯般尺與曲尺上下相仝為好用，尅定神人運宅及其年向首大利。",
